# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Expert Cooking
section Cooking 130-175

step Expert Cooking
  tip Expert Cooking raises the cap to 225; it needs skill 125 and character level 20: it is a book, Expert Cookbook (1g); the arrow picks its nearest seller for your faction. Buy it and read it.
  level 20
  train Cooking Expert "Buy and read Expert Cookbook (Expert Cooking)"

