# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Artisan Cooking: Clamlette Surprise
section Cooking 225-300

step Dirge Quikcleave
  only Alliance
  zone Ironforge
  tip Artisan Cooking comes from Dirge Quikcleave in Gadgetzan (Tanaris). The cooking trainer in Ironforge sends you; it needs skill 225 and level 35.
  skill Cooking 225
  level 35
  accept 6612                             -- Daryl Riknussun, Ironforge

step Dirge Quikcleave
  only Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Artisan Cooking comes from Dirge Quikcleave in Gadgetzan (Tanaris). The cooking trainer in Orgrimmar sends you; it needs skill 225 and level 35.
  skill Cooking 225
  level 35
  accept 6611                             -- Zamja, Orgrimmar

step Giant Eggs
  zone The Hinterlands
  tip Clamlette Surprise asks for 12 Giant Eggs, 10 Zesty Clam Meat and 20 Alterac Swiss: bring all three before you go to Tanaris, so you make the trip once. Giant Eggs drop from the owlbeasts of The Hinterlands: Savage Owlbeast (54%). Monster Omelet takes about 120 more after Artisan: farm them now too if you like.
  collect 12207 x12

step Alterac Swiss
  tip Innkeepers and food vendors sell Alterac Swiss; the arrow picks the nearest.
  buy 8932 x20 nearest

step Zesty Clam Meat
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Zesty Clam Meat comes from Big-mouth Clams: open each one, every clam holds one. The Muckshell crabs on the Dustwallow Marsh coast south-west of Theramore drop a clam about seven kills in ten, so ten clams take about fifteen kills, on your way to Tanaris. The Steeljaw Snappers on Tanaris's east coast drop them about one kill in three.
  collect 7974 x10 @55.6,63.5

step Clamlette Surprise
  zone Tanaris
  turnin 6612 only Alliance
  turnin 6611 only Horde
  accept 6610
  turnin 6610                             -- Artisan Cooking

